Package: beyond-slides
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BeyondSlides contributors <Charliewzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: apparmor (>= 4.0), bash, ca-certificates, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64 | libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libc6, libcairo2, libcups2t64 | libcups2, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libfontconfig1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libudev1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, xdg-utils
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Homepage: https://github.com/Charliewzy/BeyondSlides
Description: Local-first Chinese lecture reader
 BeyondSlides combines a lecture recording or transcript with its slide deck,
 restores readable text, aligns passages with slides, and comparatively ranks
 importance and novelty. Processing runs locally except for the explicitly
 selected analysis-model backend.
